This repo contains several automation testing frameworks that could be useful for software testing.

Airtest_Pytest_Framework is designed for mobile application testing.

browser_use_test_automation is designed for intelligent framewrok powered by an AI agent called browser_use_test_automation.

Requests_Pytest_Framework is designed for Web API testing using a Pytest framework.

Selenium_Pytest_Framework is designed for Web UI testing using a Pytest framework.

Selenium_TestNG_Framework is designed for Web UI testing but using a TestNG framework.